      "name": "dsh-acp-resume",
      "title": {
        "en": "Resumable ACP subagent",
        "zh": "可续聊 ACP 子代理"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Keep a persistent chat with an external ACP agent and reconnect via session/load after the process exits. Tested with three engines: kiro-cli, agy, and Codex; set command to use another ACP agent.",
